9. Copy gsm222 settings from ViciBox (checklist)
------------------------------------------------
On 192.168.1.200 (current Asterisk):
  asterisk -rx "sip show peer gsm222"
  grep -A 30 '^\[gsm222\]' /etc/asterisk/sip.conf
  (or pjsip if they moved it)

Write down:
  host=          (Synway LAN IP)
  port=
  username=
  secret=
  fromuser / fromdomain
  context=
  disallow/allow codecs
  insecure= / nat=
  qualify=

Paste the same values onto Ubuntu. Until Ubuntu gsm222 is UNREACHABLE=0
and a manual test call works, do not cut over production.


